svc - what is supposed to be running, and what is

  svc                    every service and its state
  svc stop netd          hold one down for this boot
  svc start netd         start it again
  svc disable netd       keep it down at every boot
  svc enable netd        undo that

Services restart on their own when they fail; one that fails too fast
too often is given up on, and the listing says so.
